==English==
{{wikipedia}}

===Etymology===
From {{confix|psych|iatry}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{a|UK}} {{IPA|/saɪˈkaɪ.əˌtɹi/}}

===Noun===
{{en-noun|-|psychiatries}}

# {{context|medicine|lang=en}} The branch of [[medicine]] that subjectively [[diagnose]]s, treats, and studies mental illness and [[behavioural]] conditions.

====Derived terms====
* [[psychiatric]]
* [[psychiatrist]]

